# Agent outputs (disposable local exports and debug mirrors). Everything
# under output/ is normally a disposable local courtesy export -- except a
# small, explicitly-kept set needed to continue Code Generator work on a
# fresh device without regenerating an eligible Build Preparation pack from
# scratch: one known-good pack, and the two Code Generator runs referenced
# in "code generator issues.md" (2026-09-06 handoff). Git will not re-include
# a file whose parent directory is still excluded, so each kept path needs
# its own ancestor chain un-ignored explicitly.
output/*
!output/README.md

!output/build-preparation/
output/build-preparation/*
!output/build-preparation/01-31-04-09-94ae4a9c/

!output/code-gen-output/
output/code-gen-output/*
!output/code-gen-output/01-56-06-09-2026-0db8503e/
!output/code-gen-output/01-56-06-09-2026-0db8503e/dist/
!output/code-gen-output/02-23-06-09-2026-fa31c124/

# Generated Preact/Vite product bundle (frontend/, docs/Frontend/05 §16) —
# built by CI/container packaging, never hand-edited or committed.
src/oryxenai/web/static/product/
